WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:03.460
So I decided to watch Us again to see what
I could pick up that I didn’t catch in my

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.620
first video, 63 Things You Missed In Us.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.849
If you haven’t seen that video, you’ll
want to watch that first, just click or tap

00:00:08.849 --> 00:00:09.849
up here.

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:12.820
I also received a ton of great comments on
that video, so if you want see some things

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.400
I missed that viewers like you picked up on,
then stick around to the end of this video.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.640
So in the previous video I talked about the
tapes next to the TV at the beginning of the

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.170
movie that may have served as influences for
Jordan Peele when making Us, such as The Goonies,

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.390
C.H.U.D and The Right Stuff.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:33.950
This time I noticed a couple more: A Nightmare
on Elm Street, perhaps for Freddy’s burned

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:38.680
face and iconic glove, and a tape with a custom
label reading either Tuesday Nites or Thursday

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.760
Nites, the text was pretty small, and I’m
not sure exactly what we’re supposed to

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.760
get from that.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.690
There was another movie I still wasn’t able
to make out on the shelf, The Man With 2 Brains,

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.020
about a man who has a tethered bond with a
female brain.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.860
Thank you Kelly for sharing that one.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.860
There are a couple things at the carnival
game where Addie’s dad wins the thriller

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:53.860
T-Shirt.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:57.579
She says she wants him to go for prize number
11, which fits in with the repeated references

00:00:57.579 --> 00:01:00.610
to 11, a number that stands for duality and
mirrorism.

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:03.150
One of the other available prizes is a Black
Flag shirt.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:06.479
I forgot to mention this in the previous video,
when I talked about all the similarities to

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:10.439
Addie’s abduction in 1986 and the coming
of the doppelgangers in the present, but there

00:01:10.439 --> 00:01:13.729
are two other Black Flag shirts before each
of those events: the carny at the Whack-a-Mole

00:01:13.729 --> 00:01:16.979
game wears one, and one of Josh’s twin daughters
wears one at the beach.

00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:19.170
But Rob in the comments took it a step further.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:22.610
“The four bars of the Black Flag logo mirror
the 11:11 theme.”

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.459
Oh my gosh, he’s right!

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.459
That’s genius!

00:01:25.459 --> 00:01:26.459
Look at this!

00:01:26.459 --> 00:01:27.459
Look at it!

00:01:27.459 --> 00:01:31.159
But that’s not even the end of it, because
Kamili reminds us that “Black Flag has a

00:01:31.159 --> 00:01:35.439
song called Rise Above, just like the tethered
rise above to kill their doppelgangers!”

00:01:35.439 --> 00:01:39.950
It’s like this band was put here all those
years ago just to be in this movie, it’s

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:40.950
too perfect.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:44.539
Another thing I noticed that occurs in both
events: the 1986 and the present is that we

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:48.509
see people eating fast food from Popperpots
Cove -- with the parrot mascot.

00:01:48.509 --> 00:01:52.209
In 1986 it’s a couple at the boardwalk,
and in the present, the family eats it at

00:01:52.209 --> 00:01:53.209
the beach house.

00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:56.499
Addie’s double is eating a strawberry in
that scene, and the son Jason doesn’t feel

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:59.920
like eating, so it’s two people eating from
the restaurant in both scenarios.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:04.060
I discussed the real Addie whistling The Itsy
Bitsy Spider when her and the other doppelgangers

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.899
dressed in red show up to the house, and I’ve
also noticed Addie whistles the same tune

00:02:07.899 --> 00:02:09.739
when she first goes into the mirror maze.

00:02:09.739 --> 00:02:14.069
And when we first see the underground, it’s
a long pull out shot of rabbits in cages.

00:02:14.069 --> 00:02:18.150
When we return later, they are running all
over the hall and the cages are empty, signifying

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.810
that those below have been set loose.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:23.180
When we’re first introduced to the family,
we see a sticker on the back window of the

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:25.379
car with four stick figures that represent
them.

00:02:25.379 --> 00:02:28.790
They’re all holding hands in a similar fashion
to the Hands Across America protests.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.900
There’s also a picture in Jason’s room
near the Merlin picture that I mentioned in

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:35.000
the other video, that depicts children holding
hands in the same pose.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.230
Also, he has this lamp that looks like a jack-in-the-box,
which is a toy where something springs up

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:42.950
from below, a representation of the doppelgangers
coming up from below.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:46.420
At the beach, Josh’s wife, Kitty brings
up the fact that she got plastic surgery,

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.970
but Adelaide's doppelganger tells her, “you
look the same as you did last year, another

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.290
example of duality.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.629
Kitty’s double, after taking over their
vacation house, sits in front of a mirror

00:02:54.629 --> 00:02:57.650
and cuts that same spot on her face with the
scissors, I’m guessing they don’t have

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:01.349
a plastic surgeon in the underground tunnels
so she’s making due with what she has.

00:03:01.349 --> 00:03:04.870
Just before the doppelganger family shows
up at the house, fake-Addie tells Gabe that

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.510
she doesn’t feel like herself, to which
he says, “I think you look like yourself,”

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:10.760
a little clue about her not being the real
Addie.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:13.850
Then, he makes a joke about how he thinks
he’d be able to beat up someone with the

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.079
same physique as her.

00:03:15.079 --> 00:03:18.920
She doesn’t take it well, and he apologizes,
claiming he was just trying to “lighten

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:19.920
the mood.”

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.920
Right as he says the word, “lighten”,
the power goes out, which could be another

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:27.129
example of the strange coincidences that lead
up to the uprising, just like the disc landing

00:03:27.129 --> 00:03:28.590
perfectly on the beach towel.

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:32.489
“Mush” was kind enough to point out more
about that moment with the disk.

00:03:32.489 --> 00:03:36.019
“The frisbee landed precisely on one of
the blue circles on the beach towel.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:40.100
The towel was white, it had blue circles on
it and the frisbee was red with a star on it.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.040
US.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:41.780
Us.”

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.200
That’s a great point Mush, and you know
what else Mush?

00:03:44.209 --> 00:03:48.209
It fits in with several clues about the doubles
being something that only happens in America.

00:03:48.209 --> 00:03:52.459
The opening text only mentions tunnels that
run under America, when asked who they are,

00:03:52.459 --> 00:03:56.719
Addie replies with “we are Americans”,
and the news broadcast seems to imply this

00:03:56.719 --> 00:03:59.780
is a national crisis, making no mention of
other countries.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:03.480
Also, the fake-Addie who once lived down in
the tunnels suggests that they go to Mexico

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:07.659
to escape, and she even has a book about Mexico
on the shelf in their vacation home.

00:04:07.659 --> 00:04:12.189
The scene at the house with the family vs
their tethers has a few things I found interesting.

00:04:12.189 --> 00:04:15.950
For example, the family is almost never on
camera together with the doppelgangers.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.209
This is probably just to save some money on
visual effects and make it easier to shoot

00:04:19.209 --> 00:04:22.950
the movie, but it does fit in with the idea
that only one of them can exist on the surface.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:27.600
Pluto, the copy of Jason, is the one to start
a fire in the fireplace, he also dies in the

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.850
fire at the end.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:33.240
TellanLee said something I really like, that
the red suit family sits in front of the fireplace,

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.330
therefore casting a shadow over the normal
family, symbolically switching the roles.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:41.410
I also noticed the table they sit across from
each other at is a mirror -- so they’re

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.070
seeing themselves in the mirror.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.540
There’s another reversal of roles when the
daughter Zora is chased by her tether, and

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.680
the tether jumps on top of a car and looks
down at her.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:51.950
Here are a few clues I found about Addie being
switched with Red.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:55.250
When they’re trying to devise a plan she
says, “they think like us.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.380
They know where we are.”

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.160
How could she know that without having been
one herself?

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:02.970
When the two doppelgangers of her kids die,
she can be seen looking remorseful, even trying

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.840
to stop Jason’s doppelganger from backing
into the fire.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:09.910
Some people were theorizing that this is because
Jason was switched at some point with a doppelganger,

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.390
like possibly the previous summer when Jason
got locked in the closet, or possibly when

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:14.910
he goes to the bathroom at the beach.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.360
I don’t see how that would be possible.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.940
Even if the burn marks did come after the
supposed switch was made, I don’t see why

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:25.590
Jason would forget about his original family
and inexplicably start acting like a dog,

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:29.740
when nothing of that sort happened to Addie
when she was forced to go underground as child.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:33.690
If that was the case, he probably would have
wanted to go with his original mother.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:37.820
So I have to stick with my original theory
that Jason has the ability to control Pluto,

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:41.880
because his Mom is a doppelganger, so he’s
part doppelganger himself.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:46.220
There were two other clues you may have missed
about the Addie that we follow as an adult

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:49.760
being the fake, and the one underground being
the real Adelaide.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:58.960
When Gabe’s wife goes back into the house
to get the deceased Josh’s car keys, she

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.700
kills the last remaining of the two tether
twins.

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:05.280
When doing so she makes grunting noises similar
to that of the other doppelgangers.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:09.500
Also, back in the 80s when we see the flashback
of her parents taking her to the doctor, she’s

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:13.340
playing with these toy animals, some of the
same animals seen on the wall of the mirror

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.730
maze that she lived under.

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:18.881
At the end of the movie in that last shot,
the number 1111 can be seen on top of the

00:06:18.881 --> 00:06:20.550
ambulance that they ride away in.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:23.470
Now let's look at the rest of the comments
left on my previous video.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:24.870
“Another Easter Egg.

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:28.060
Nobody is talking about the son eating dry
Fruit Loops while they were sitting at the

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:31.000
round table at their friends’ house after
killing the doppelgangers.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.560
Little homage to Get Out I think.”

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:36.390
Get Out, of course, being director Jordan
Peele’s previous film, where this lady eats

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.280
some Fruit Loops.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.320
This next comment is one of my favorites.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.320
One of the things I mentioned in the other
video was we hear the announcer of the baseball

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:51.980
game say the score is tied 11-11.

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:56.950
Ryan Smith adds that “the announcers mention
Minnesota, who’s pro team is called the

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:57.950
Twins.”

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.780
OK -- how about the Twins ‘rose up’ from
being the worst team in baseball in 2016 to

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:05.980
make the playoffs the following year, just
as the doppelgangers ‘rose up’ from….

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:06.980
OK I’m kidding.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.410
It’s true though, they did improve by 26
wins in 2017.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:14.340
“Adelaide is also wearing a white shirt
that continuously gets more and more red with

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.470
blood, indicating her true character being
revealed as the movie progresses.”

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:21.400
Also not a thing you missed, but this was
an interesting comment.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.690
“Remember the Simpsons episode where Bart
has an evil twin named Hugo?

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:29.110
Hugo is raised in the dark and fed on raw
fish… at the end they realise Hugo was the

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:30.110
real Bart.”

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.110
I do remember that episode.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:34.660
I think what they realized at the end was
that the Bart we know is actually the evil

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.440
twin, and I believe that was a Treehouse of
Horror segment.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:40.670
I’ve actually been thinking about doing
a Treehouse of Horror Things You Missed episode

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:43.270
one of these days, so let me know if that's
something you’d like to see.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.650
“I think the creepy voice of Red actually
came from her voice box being crushed when

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.050
she was attacked as a child.”

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:51.890
He or she is talking about Addie being strangled
by the doppelganger in the hall of mirrors.

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:56.250
I saw several comments bring this up and I
guess it could be possible, but I don’t

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.920
think that’s the case based on my own…
uh… kinky experiences.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:03.780
But, she was strangled by a child, so probably
not strong enough to do any damage.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:07.290
I think it has more to do with the fact that
the doppelgangers only communicate through

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.410
grunting so she didn’t really get much experience
with speech, and maybe added to by the fact

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:14.510
that she hadn’t breathed the air on the
surface for over 30 years.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:19.300
Charles Ugas adds, “I took the Jaws shirt
as a hint that the terror comes from below.”

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:19.800
Yes!

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:20.460
Love it!

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:21.140
Next.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:21.800
Things.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:26.040
“The little girl is wearing a greenish / turquoise
jumper that says “tho”, which means “rabbit”

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.040
in Vietnamese.”

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.140
It checks out.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.180
Translating all my videos to Vietnamese is
finally paying off.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:32.180
Thanks David.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.340
“There’s also the duality in the Michael
Jackson references… the Thriller shirt represents

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:39.900
normal vs zombie Michael, the red Thriller
outfit vs the tethered’s red jumpsuits and

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:43.240
Michael’s single rhinestone glove vs the
tethered’s plain leather glove.”

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.240
Thank you!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:48.120
The one thing I was not really getting the
point of was the gloves in Us.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:52.650
Shy Franklinstein also added that she thinks
“the werewolf mask is reference to MJs Thriller

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.420
and that video’s surprise ending.”

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.480
Could be something there.

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.650
“Some mistakes were make.”

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:57.650
Uh, oh.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:58.650
Brace for criticism.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:08:59.810
“The exit signs were red.”

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.220
Yeah I don’t know why I said they were green.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:06.150
I guess just because they sometimes are green
and I remembered it wrong, but red fits the

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.320
color scheme of the movie obviously a lot
better.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.010
“The mask was Chewbacca.”

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:13.610
I saw quite a few comments saying that, and
if this is supposed to be Chewy, that’s

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.000
a really, really bad mask.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.020
I’m gonna stick with Wolfman on that one
-- which also goes nicely with the Thriller

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.240
reference, since that video contains a werewolf
movie.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.430
“The parents weren’t doing Rock, Paper,
Scissors, a random couple were.”

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:25.520
Yeah, absolutely right.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.770
I guess I just remembered it wrong when I
got out of the theater the first time.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:32.080
Also, someone else posted: “The tethered
version of the couple playing rock paper scissors

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.020
were only shooting scissors at the end.”

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:37.530
The next one talks about the Alexa-like virtual
assistant in Josh’s house.

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:40.880
“I feel like naming the “Alexa” gadget
“Ophelia” was clever.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:45.020
Ophelia was driven mad by the dualities in
her life, such as whether or not Hamlet loves

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:49.520
her or is only using her, and whether she
is pure, as her family sees her, or an object,

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.810
as Hamlet sees her.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:55.210
She also ends up killing herself, and you
can’t get much more heavy-handed than that.”

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:59.020
This is a great point, I knew there had to
have been some reason to give the virtual

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:03.840
assistant a Shakespearean name, but I wasn’t
making the connection until I read your comment,

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:04.860
thank you Robin.

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:11.460
“9:11 who else saw the big chungus, laughing-so-hard-I’m-crying-emoji,
laughing-so-hard-I’m-crying-emoji, laughing-so-hard-I’m-crying-emoji.”

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:15.180
This is more a Thing You (might have) Missed
in my episode of Things You Missed.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:19.130
When I was talking about the rabbits, I snuck
in a picture of Big Chungus, at 9 minutes

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:20.360
and eleven seconds.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:24.270
Not only does this contain the number 11,
but 9/11 is the date of the attacks on the

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:27.090
Twin Towers in New York City, another twin
reference.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:31.900
The towers themselves form the number 11,
and it was a coordinated attack on America,

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:35.580
just as the doppelgangers make a coordinated
attack on America in the movie.

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:38.870
When the Twin Towers were built, they were
the tallest buildings in the world, just as

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:43.310
Big Chungus, is the biggest rabbit the world
has even known, and if you don’t believe

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:48.490
me, then I don’t think you can fathom just
how big Big Chungus actually is…

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:52.340
Joker Laugh also points out that they mention
the Twin Towers in the Hands Across America

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:53.580
ad at the beginning.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:57.100
CaapriceTube has some great comments about
the meaning behind character names.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:11:01.051
Adelaide’s name, is like the Australian
city, and Australia is known as “the land

00:11:01.051 --> 00:11:02.051
down under”.

00:11:02.051 --> 00:11:06.550
Zora means “dawn” in slavic languages,
symbolizing the transition from night to day.

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:10.100
Someone also added her doppelganger is called
Umbrae, which means shadow.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.150
Should have known that considering Umbreon
is the dark type Eevee.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:16.621
Speaking of Nintendo games, there’s one
more that I wanted to highlight and it’s

00:11:16.621 --> 00:11:21.010
actually something I joked about wayyy back
in December when I covered first trailer for

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.010
Us.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.010
Let’s roll that clip.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.470
“And when they’re initially walking to
the beach, their long shadows represent a

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.350
dark version of themselves.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:32.470
Since they have a dark version of themselves,
they may also be the next hit Nintendo franchise.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:36.750
In fact if you pause at 1 minutes and 53 seconds
into the trailer, you can clearly see Mario

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.780
is standing there holding hands with one of
the doppelgangers.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.540
This one’s called Scissors Mario.”

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:45.680
While I was partially joking at the time,
after seeing the movie I wouldn’t be surprised

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:49.040
if the inclusion of a character with a dark
doppelganger was intentional.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:53.600
Yuri Koller adds an excellent point, “Super
Mario is a character that goes into tubes

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.600
underground.”

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.730
I love that idea.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:59.430
Thanks to everyone who left a comment -- apologies
if I couldn’t include yours, if I included

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:01.500
all of them, the video would be like four
days long.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.690
Click the playlist on the left if you want
